{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "35f97842ec8e911ca4b5455fc38051916e37842ef6410e8e9728d3372bba643e", "ja": "即席アイドル料理", "zh": "速食偶像料理", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0800c2eed8bcdedc589127f8f8bd51275efc88743056bb134c23732967acc3d6", "ja": "ロケ地である島に到着したアイドル達。自由\n時間を思い思いに過ごした後、今日の食事は\n自炊だと知らされる。千鶴がセレブらしく率\n先し、一同は手際よく料理をこなす。撮影を\n前に、みんなの気持ちがまとまった。", "zh": "抵达拍摄取景地所在岛屿的偶像们。大家各自\n度过了自由时间后，得知今天的饭菜要自己做。\n千鹤率先展现出名媛风范，带领大家井然有序地\n完成了料理。在拍摄开始前，大家的心也凝聚到\n了一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "40f667edffc1625040bc7680e8475dbf7bed1495a8f6b1251a21ee59f524a5eb", "ja": "（一同は、撮影場所として借りた洋館にやってきた。\n宿泊場所は、この洋館の離れになる予定だ）", "zh": "（大家来到了租作拍摄场地的西式洋房。住宿地点预计是这栋洋房的附楼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2f2bd8d1633fa888773799d4a42148edacdc65112fe02185890ed86205128fb6", "ja": "みんな、荷物を片付けたら今日は自由時間でいいぞ。\n但しケガなどはしないよう、気をつけるように……。", "zh": "大家收拾好行李后，今天就自由活动吧。\n不过要注意安全，别受伤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "0a489a07b923735cb9b73ad0f92f5d94423ac7c0484b62f1de0d1d9399fc961b", "ja": "青い空が！　白い雲が！　綺麗な海が呼んでいる！\nさあ、エレナちゃん！　いっくぞー♪", "zh": "蓝蓝的天空！洁白的云朵！美丽的大海正在呼唤我们！来吧，艾蕾娜！出发咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "12fa60a7149d4732a66d1ccaaa097f9a1f5602c0f4caf68167c044dccfca1426", "ja": "イェーイ！", "zh": "耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "9b47042418768bb51203cc3722fc737c33b524cb40c4091699dbffb8a278e960", "ja": "あっ！　茜、どこに行くつもり？\nエレナも、先に荷物を片付けてからって言ったでしょ！", "zh": "啊！茜，你打算去哪儿？\n还有艾莲娜，我不是说过要先把行李收拾好吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "471d4777bac9a9cca4678c27a8372074ab005f476aa6103453bfde7f529263c9", "ja": "エヘヘ……ごめんネ、リツコ！\nあとで、ちゃーんとやるから許してネ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……对不起啦，律子！\n我之后一定会好好做的，原谅我嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "a1501e20bf71021563641f072a0d05154bd9c541ed6a9cff7233226c6dbf1982", "ja": "あっ、コラー！　ふたりとも、戻ってきなさーい！\n……まったく、あの子たちったら。", "zh": "啊，喂——！你们两个，快给我回来——！\n……真是的，那两个孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "6bc68ea7544fd0cde2ed06ec664e6998f07b09ec7c4f563db8e99c56faad41a3", "ja": "けど、はしゃぎたくなる気持ちもわかりますわ。\nわたくしも、日常を離れた心持ちがしますもの。", "zh": "不过，我也能理解她们想要尽情玩闹的心情。\n毕竟连我也觉得自己仿佛暂时离开了日常生活。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "8c2aff9e7c010b9fa22b3fdd282e4f02ff2699cda41adbd0cf409b5d4a1e57c4", "ja": "ここが、ホラー映画の舞台になるのよねえ……。\nあら？　そういえば、志保がいないわね。", "zh": "这里就是恐怖电影的拍摄场地吧……  \n哎呀？这么说来，志保不在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "eea4b86ac24c1bcf8f03c719051a17b54c214a70074d1d908592ce6ff6031c72", "ja": "志保ちゃんなら、先に部屋に行ったわ。\n荷物を片付けるって。", "zh": "志保的话，已经先去房间了。\n说是要收拾行李。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "eaa5b12510268155d64a60efffd219a866d7a3108200b27d782a01a279bb7a4b", "ja": "相変わらず、志保はしっかりしていますのね。\nわたくし達の中でも一番年下ですのに、感心ですわ。", "zh": "志保还是一如既往地稳重呢。\n明明是我们之中年纪最小的，却真是令人佩服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "cd6cef8120e7ebe3eae2eb45dffdaec977f7e91bd520b942f7cd92bc9fb9d2a6", "ja": "そうね。でも……。", "zh": "是啊。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "e1834dd4cdc8ebb1b24b81025512553741683e27f60d4591e927f1123934126f", "ja": "歌織？　どうかしたの？", "zh": "歌织？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "41919bec631592225195c365e3486e69c03003485bda5a1d4608e1276edb1ba9", "ja": "あ……ううん、なんでもないの。\n本当に、素敵な景色ね。", "zh": "啊……没什么，什么事都没有。\n这里的景色真的很美呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4fe4a51e476f07296af1b26ea370cfe6f8feb0f3860bd39c9ff80fc9b228ee5b", "ja": "（スタッフさんの準備は、深夜までかかりそうだ。\n撮影は早朝から。食事の準備は……）", "zh": "（工作人员的准备工作看来要持续到深夜。拍摄从一大早就开始。吃饭的准备……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "555c9ca7f34242aeb795aff3994e048cd909f1874175e8ad514a33ec3951cdd1", "ja": "たっだいま～！　海で遊んでたら、のどが渇いたヨ～。\nあれ？　{$P$}、何してるノ？", "zh": "我回来啦～！在海边玩的时候口渴了哟～。\n咦？{$P$}，你在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ef58b56ef227d42fa523d206e5f3fca40bab90a74fe8d22358260b0554a60504", "ja": "ちょうどよかった。\n食事の準備をするから手伝ってくれ！", "zh": "正好。\n我要准备饭菜，来帮忙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "338d48c08796922c2bc5f3535a5014b17f3aa9844534d75b65e3f5cf25861d4e", "ja": "食事の……。", "zh": "饭菜的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "ccc9f1e6dbc5aacd86d3b1e11e54f01a19746f4009bd14a0ae3bd7775814d9e0", "ja": "準備？", "zh": "准备？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "050e60260d37d88e03cb288b1697acfb8f267123e33ec008a290a85fd105f4c8", "ja": "ああ。基本的にはケータリングにお任せだけど、\n今日だけ自分達で準備させてもらう事になったんだ。", "zh": "对。基本上交给餐饮团队就行，但今天我们决定自己准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5902f2fd525b33bd1cd56e4856ffa3bb510d07de47228a2a4d435ecb0d9062a1", "ja": "スタッフさんは深夜までかかりそうだし、\nこれくらいはな。", "zh": "工作人员估计要忙到深夜，这点小事就由我们来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "ad9efe64f9a0cdf1f357a5d03811c707a20c1834e0c898670a73a89786e2daf7", "ja": "まさかの自炊！？　ここ、リゾートじゃないの？\nねえねえ、バカンス気分は～！？", "zh": "居然要自己做饭！？这里不是度假村吗？\n喂喂，度假的心情去哪了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ddd11668e0ad1d889a15258f012b2887f6bef4902c2f9c7330c85c7af5f22c97", "ja": "（結局、茜に泣きつかれて援軍を呼んだ）", "zh": "（结果茜哭着来求我，只好叫来了援军。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "17ed0758e757233080f4a25a3180875f9b42580b72d4f5f4299229a8d0bf22da", "ja": "すみません、千鶴さん。大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "对不起，千鹤小姐。您没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "5e29e82512e4ba214dc6803afd46cb09d24aa60187abb6a344d5b3418152a5fa", "ja": "おまかせくださいまし！　お母……いえ！\n我が家シェフ直伝の腕を、ふるってさしあげますわ！", "zh": "请尽管交给我吧！妈妈……不对！我会为您施展家中主厨亲传的手艺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "5b3b2d29cc8ee9ec0352a8ae7bf774c844e1218dfde40e88c3379e6e6ca0ace2", "ja": "それに、助っ人もいてくださいますから。\n律子、歌織さん！　よろしくお願いしますわね！", "zh": "而且还有帮手在呢。\n律子、歌织小姐！就拜托你们啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "c65c44f23315ad6248896ebd3f5cb26fa4bfd0aa8f2686ee26da02a0d982251b", "ja": "まかせてください！　……とまでは言いませんけど、\nまあ、猫の手くらいにはなるかなと。", "zh": "包在我身上！……虽然还不至于这么夸口，\n不过我想，哪怕帮不上大忙，打个下手还是可以的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "243c35e4683754258cc08d7600ac447b7e6d224e9f570ec08517d41025299e2b", "ja": "私も、お料理は嫌いじゃないから……\nなんでも言ってね、千鶴ちゃん。", "zh": "我也不讨厌做饭……所以有什么需要尽管告诉我，千鹤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "9ae4ddef2d15f241917efdbd5faf26fbc31f15c102f6d696890f4e31bdfc712a", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nそれでは、さっそく始めますわよ！", "zh": "非常感谢！\n那么，我们这就开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "086fb647a4a374b9a3eac11a3f1f2ad5cb9326e9a641df465681920a8d625b6c", "ja": "（千鶴さんは自分でも野菜を切りながら、テキパキと\n指示を出している。うーん、さすがセレブだ……！）", "zh": "（千鹤小姐一边亲自切着蔬菜，一边也利落地发出指示。嗯，不愧是名媛……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "b6cd60e84e433ce4500f57ed0ad8f9d21bb4a34a703ff21cf341393499a4f9d5", "ja": "伊織？　そんなところに立って、どうしたんだ。\n誰かに用事か？", "zh": "伊织？站在那里干什么呢。\n是来找谁的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "913bbdec1136b58c1b2c577090b235acfb99b8a04e31d194f1c98bbe8ee1ef62", "ja": "えっ？　あっ……い、忙しいって聞いたから、\n助っ人してあげようかと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "诶？啊……我、我听说你很忙，所以本来想来帮你一把的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "8c8ddaf523186f48d6ecbcff5c1fdc234bc23722818428495904de0d6857db38", "ja": "歌織さん、次はこちらのお野菜をお願いしますわ！\n律子！　そちら、お鍋が溢れていますわよ！", "zh": "歌织小姐，接下来请处理这边的蔬菜！\n律子！那边的锅要溢出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "ea979b2ac23c061aaaad48345e393319b141e102b1ba574b00341c4f2c1ff37c", "ja": "えっ？　ああっ、本当！\n火を止めて……と。ふぅ、セーフ！", "zh": "咦？啊，真的！\n先把火关掉……呼，得救了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "9e8cda57cf9a79714841a6dec25baa8d8a6086b0d517d3e9396a97aa44f2c582", "ja": "……私は、料理を運ぶだけにしたほうが良さそうね。\n{$P$}、お皿をちょうだい。", "zh": "……我还是只负责端菜比较好吧。\n{$P$}，把盘子递给我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "9aa0e3fa056da7829a8f66fb692eec6a99a50831cebd84f46b31023e1e7d4648", "ja": "（千鶴さんの指示で、あっという間に料理が完成し、\nスタッフの人達に差し入れまでできた）", "zh": "（在千鹤的指挥下，料理转眼间就做好了，甚至还给工作人员送去了慰问餐）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "2670e1ae0e7f0e3ce79bdfcab77117a8bcb1991f80bc5b18d81583511d24f4b9", "ja": "おいしい……。\nこんなにおいしいお肉、初めて食べました。", "zh": "好好吃……\n我还是第一次吃到这么美味的肉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1038_052kao", "source_sha256": "1746edfe1f687e074140370ebc957a1985b4dffb6673c18f449a3fbcefc917fd", "ja": "本当、レストランで食べるよりもおいしい……。\nすごいわ、千鶴ちゃん。本物を知っているからこそね。", "zh": "真的，比在餐厅里吃的还要好吃……\n太厉害了，千鹤。正因为你了解真正的美味啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1039_038chz", "source_sha256": "3385411b16ea758c8b608e6fbbb6a80ae3fb1051e5e46d8752632b5e9127acf2", "ja": "えっ！？　も、もちろんですわ！", "zh": "诶！？当、当然了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "48a1623e38e0b531aa3cb8a50955673985b65e5f1726b2bf5a1f7b31ea153169", "ja": "肉汁が……！　あふれる肉汁が、茜ちゃんの\n口の中でアルプス一万尺を踊ってるよ……！", "zh": "肉汁……！满溢而出的肉汁，正在小茜的嘴里跳《阿尔卑斯一万尺》呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "406e0846f4970e136c4b04c5ee74aa1ecba307ec32f772f2c14a4d672e38bc32", "ja": "みんなで一緒に食べてると、なんだか\nパーティーみたいで楽しいネ！", "zh": "大家聚在一起吃，感觉就像\n在开派对一样，真开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "3d1e5b404ae5acb2401f1cfaf5f7c8ccf0304f8c3d00eb615a5028052e151999", "ja": "見た目はシンプルですけど、手間暇がかかっていて……\n食べる人への、千鶴さんの愛情が感じられます。", "zh": "看起来很简单，但其实花了不少心思……能感受到千鶴小姐对用餐者的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1043_038chz", "source_sha256": "53c313e9e2d317c9664fb8e5c7202ed1904335285af41f5bc09ea5aea072cea1", "ja": "そ、そう言っていただけると、光栄ですわ！\nオーッホッホッホッ！　げほっ、ごほっ。", "zh": "能、能得到您这样的评价，是我的荣幸！\n哦呵呵呵呵！咳、咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1044_038chz", "source_sha256": "0a6820ec91282fd1760b6f46fa0aab8caf2dc70de9d05dbdd96a24ab8b10a38d", "ja": "みなさん、おかわりもありますから……\nたくさん食べて、明日からの撮影も頑張りますわよ！", "zh": "大家，这里还有可以添的哦……\n多吃一点，明天的拍摄也要好好加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "b1383a9c62884ccb3f97ce0e1c0e07636790e0f045c133c74cb295d5a9f81996", "ja": "（アイドル達の手料理で、全員の気持ちがひとつに\nなった気がするな。明日はいよいよ、撮影開始だ！）", "zh": "（感觉大家的心因为偶像们亲手做的料理而连在了一起。\n明天终于要开始拍摄了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
